     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">In case it&#39;s helpful, the implementation in tinyVAST is <a href=\"https://github.com/vast-lib/tinyVAST/blob/main/src/tinyVAST.cpp#L456-L460\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/vast-lib/tinyVAST/blob/main/src/tinyVAST.cpp%23L456-L460&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792461460400000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2onZISvJUzr_h_3UXgUkA1\">here</a>.  The term `log_one_minus_mu1`  helps with numerical overflow in calculating the Bernoulli (presence/absence) term.</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
